WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.670
- Have you ever been hit by a sports ball?

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:03.503
- I have.

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:05.510
I have been hit at a Major
League Baseball game.

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:06.680
I'll set the scene for you,

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:08.060
I was on third base side.

00:00:08.060 --> 00:00:09.770
So that's right where third base is.

00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:11.410
First, second, third, home.

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:13.930
Third base side, guy hit a line drive,

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:15.410
which means straight across.

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:17.500
There was nothing that broke,

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.000
like, where the ball was coming.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.690
The security guard that was with me

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:23.430
actually ducked when it came my way

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:24.960
and I went like this

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:27.770
and it smacked me, clear
as day, in the mouth.

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:28.603
There it is!

00:00:28.603 --> 00:00:29.590
Hot.

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:30.570
- [Kelly] Holy moly!
(audience murmurs)

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:32.420
- It bounced off my face

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.980
and landed behind me, but I was fine.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:36.820
Doctor said I had a jaw
still, you know what I mean?

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:38.310
- Oh, my gosh!

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:39.350
That, I would brag about that.

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:41.100
- Yeah.
- I would brag about that.

